# MOONWITNESS XV — TODO v2 CANDIDATE (UNCOMMITTED)

> **DRAFT ONLY. NOT AN ACTIVE BACKLOG.** Produced for user review from remote `main` `05eff5d68571c49240b04ea19dc52082eab6ad28` on 2026-10-26. Do not mark any item DONE from this proposal; do not overwrite the checked-in `TODO.md` until a 203/203 mapping and user authorization.

## Decision

Replace the planning model, not the historical evidence. Reuse six existing apps (Dock, Headquarters, Cockpit, ARSY under `apps/radio`, AI Gateway, Sentinel) and current MoonQL domain addons. Do not add new standalone apps. Do not duplicate reviewed engines or claim a demo is live.

## Legacy migration invariant

`TODO.md` v1 contains **203 unique IDs, 99 checked and 104 open**. All original rows, statuses, dependencies and evidence must be archived under a stable historical path during eventual adoption, with a **203-of-203 crosswalk**. A checked legacy task is `LEGACY_CLAIMED_DONE` until its gate is still valid at the adopted HEAD; an unchecked task may be `PARTIALLY_IMPLEMENTED`. Never infer actual remaining workload from checkbox counts alone.

### State model

| State | Meaning | Evidence |
|---|---|---|
| `DISCOVERED` | Candidate found in code or audit | File:line / commit |
| `TRIAGE` | Scope, owner, and duplication undecided | Owner decision required |
| `READY` | Unique scope, dependency gates, acceptance clear | Impact & negative test specified |
| `CLAIMED` | Coordinator grants exclusive path claim | Worker ID, baseline SHA, lease expiry |
| `IN_PROGRESS` | Work done only in assigned scope | Worktree/diff ref |
| `IMPLEMENTED` | Changes exist, unverified end to end | Commit/diff |
| `VERIFIED` | Focused test & negative tests pass | Exact SHA logs |
| `DONE` | Relevant global CI and human required gates pass | CI URL, accepted evidence |
| `BLOCKED` | Prerequisite unavailable or unsafe | Blocking reason + owner |
| `DEFERRED` | Outside accepted release slice | Scope decision |
| `SUPERSEDED` | Covered by a different unique task | Replacement ID |

### Agent coordination (no new branch required)

One coordinator writes the active `TODO.md` and integrates into `main`. Agents can draft nonconflicting patches in isolated local directories/detached worktrees (without creating GitHub branches), but **must not push concurrently to `main`**. Coordinator grants file-path leases and integrates one SHA at a time; do not force-push/reset or cherry-pick unreviewed divergent branches. A changed upstream SHA triggers recheck before status update. Shared files (`pnpm-lock.yaml`, `package.json`, `apps/radio/src/addons.ts`, `packages/moonui/moon.css`, `TODO.md`) are single-writer.

### Priority and acceptance

P0 = release/security/provenance/compatibility gate, P1 = core user value, P2 = optional research. D1..D4 = relative complexity. **A green compile is not user acceptance**; include denied-role, stale-status, privacy and deprecation cases. The first task for each package is audit/reuse, not rewrite.

